# OpenCode Go API key (https://opencode.ai/auth → OpenCode Zen → Go subscription).
# The key is sent as `Authorization: Bearer <key>` to the OpenCode Go
# OpenAI-compatible endpoint at https://opencode.ai/zen/go/v1.
#
# Place the real value in the (gitignored) `.env` file, not here.
OPENCODE_GO_API_KEY=replace-with-your-opencode-go-api-key

# Cohere Embed API (https://dashboard.cohere.com/api-keys).
# Used for v1 semantic memory: embed-multilingual-v3.0 → LanceDB.
# rig reads COHERE_API_KEY via cohere::Client::from_env().
COHERE_API_KEY=replace-with-your-cohere-api-key
